   $q$Listen. Here is how Grandma Lu makes pancakes on Sunday morning. First, Grandma Lu mixes flour, milk and an egg in a big bowl to make batter. Next, Grandma Lu pours a scoop of batter into a hot pan. When little bubbles pop up all over the top, Grandma Lu flips the pancake over. A minute later, it is golden brown and ready to eat. What tells Grandma Lu it is time to flip the pancake? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"a dog barks","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"a dog barks"}},{"text":"a bell rings","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"a bell rings"}},{"text":"bubbles on top","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"bubbles on top"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$bubbles on top$q$, $q$Grandma Lu waits for little bubbles to pop up all over the top. The bubbles show it is time to flip the pancake.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
