   $q$Listen. Room nine has a pet goldfish named Bubbles. Each morning, one class helper feeds Bubbles just a tiny pinch of fish food. Too much food can sink to the bottom, rot and make the water dirty. Every week, the class changes some of the water, so the tank stays clean. Clean water helps a pet fish stay healthy. Why does the helper give Bubbles only a tiny pinch of food? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"to make it sing","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"to make it sing"}},{"text":"to keep water clean","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"to keep water clean"}},{"text":"to make it sleep","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"to make it sleep"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$to keep water clean$q$, $q$Too much food can rot and make the water dirty. A tiny pinch keeps the water clean, and clean water helps Bubbles stay healthy.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
